Package: valytics
Title: Statistical Methods for Analytical Method Comparison and Validation
Version: 0.3.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Marcello", "Grassi", , "marcello.grassi@tum.de", 
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0008-8904-4988"))
Description: Statistical methods for analytical method comparison and validation 
    studies. Implements Bland-Altman analysis, Passing-Bablok regression, and 
    Deming regression for method comparison, along with tools for setting 
    quality goals based on biological variation and calculating Six Sigma 
    metrics. Commonly used in clinical laboratory method validation following 
    CLSI guidelines. Provides publication-ready plots and comprehensive
    statistical summaries.
